        "id": "2026-09-17-the-sixth-fork-die-sechs-exist",
        "title": "The Sixth Fork: Die sechs existenziellen Weichenstellungen der Menschheit",
        "date": "2026-09-17",
        "displayDate": "17. September 2026",
        "sourceUrl": "https://metatrends.substack.com/p/the-sixth-fork",
        "sourceType": "substack",
