        "title": "What’s Your Moonshot? – XPRIZE-Wettbewerbe und technologischer Hebel im Zeitalter von AGI",
        "date": "2026-09-12",
        "displayDate": "12. September 2026",
        "sourceUrl": "https://metatrends.substack.com/p/whats-your-moonshot",
        "sourceType": "substack",
